  "scope": "Audited signature slots, text extraction/recovery settings and existing-page geometry/resource provenance and raw/bounded streams and named image XObjects. Merge metadata source modes. Remaining Rust API pending audit; no total parity claim. Split options and suggested byte-result names. Tagged preflight and explicit preparation. Base-document incremental append/replacement, all writer fields and Info policy. CID collection sequences and bounded font glyph/vertical-metric inspection. Limited core PDF/A validation, eight levels, findings and operation errors.",
